# Build contexts only need source and the processed TES tables. Excluding the rest
# takes the context from ~2.7 GB to a few hundred MB, which every image build pays.
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.scratch
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
refiner/tests
refiner/tes/data/source-tes-groupers
.git
